Package: ggumap
Title: UMAP Layers for 'ggplot2'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Jeroen", "Janssens", , "jeroen@jeroenjanssens.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-5878-8924")),
    person("Apple Inc.", role = "cph",
           comment = "Rust implementation of UMAP and NNDescent ('embedding-atlas')"),
    person("Authors of the dependency Rust crates", role = "ctb",
           comment = "see inst/AUTHORS")
  )
Description: Adds a statistic and a geometry to 'ggplot2' that compute
    Uniform Manifold Approximation and Projection (UMAP) embeddings
    (McInnes, Healy and Melville (2018) <doi:10.48550/arXiv.1802.03426>)
    directly inside a plot. Feature columns are selected with 'tidyselect'
    syntax. Computation is done by Apple's multi-threaded 'Rust' port of
    'umap-learn' and 'PyNNDescent', bundled with the package.
